ucts you purchase from us shall be arbitrated by state or federal court and your consent to exclusive jurisdiction and venue of such courts."}]},{id:"fhir-api",title:"FHIR API",navTitle:"FHIR API",blocks:[{type:"paragraph",text:"AaNeelConnect provides FHIR-based application programming interface (\u201cAPI\u201d) technology and interoperability services to Medicare Advantage and other health plan clients. Our API services are designed to support secure electronic access, exchange, and use of health information in accordance with applicable technical standards, contractual requirements, and interoperability requirements."},{type:"subheading",text:"Authorized Use"},{type:"paragraph",text:"Access to AaNeelConnect FHIR APIs is permitted only through authorized authentication and authorization mechanisms and for lawful purposes. Users, applications, and developers accessing our APIs may not:"},{type:"list",items:["Attempt to access information beyond the scope authorized by the applicable individual, Health Plan, or API authorization;","Circumvent or interfere with authentication, authorization, security, or access controls;","Misuse credentials, access tokens, client identifiers, or other security mechanisms;","Introduce malicious code or interfere with the security, integrity, or availability of the API or associated systems; or","Use information obtained through the API in violation of applicable law or applicable authorization."]},{type:"subheading",text:"Third-Party Applications"},{type:"paragraph",text:"Our FHIR API services may enable a Health Plan member to authorize disclosure of health information to an independently operated third-party application."},{type:"paragraph",text:"AaNeelConnect does not own, operate, endorse, or control independent third-party applications unless expressly stated otherwise. Users should review the privacy policy and terms of any third-party application before authorizing access to health information."},{type:"paragraph",text:"Once an authorized transmission to an independent third-party application is completed, the third party's terms and privacy practices govern its subsequent handling of the information, subject to applicable law."},{type:"subheading",text:"API Security and Availability"},{type:"paragraph",text:"AaNeelConnect may implement reasonable security controls necessary to protect its APIs, systems, users, and information from unauthorized access, misuse, or security threats. API access may be restricted or suspended when reasonably necessary to address a security threat, compromised credentials, unauthorized activity, or other circumstances permitted by applicable law."},{type:"paragraph",text:"Nothing in these Terms is intended to prohibit or unreasonably interfere with access, exchange, or use of health information required under applicable interoperability requirements."},{type:"subheading",text:"Health Plan Responsibilities"},{type:"paragraph",text:"AaNeelConnect provides technology and services supporting Health Plan interoperability activities. Each Health Plan remains responsible for the regulatory and operational obligations applicable to it as a regulated health plan, except where responsibilities have been expressly delegated to AaNeel."}]},{id:"comments-reviews-emails",title:"Comments, Reviews, and Emails",navTitle:"Comments & Reviews",blocks:[{type:"paragraph",text:"Visitors may post content if it is not obscene, illegal, defamatory, threatening, infringing of intellectual property rights, invasive of privacy or injurious in any other way to third parties. Content must be free of software viruses, political campaign, and commercial solicitation. We reserve all rights (but not the obligation) to remove and/or edit such content. When you post your content, you grant AaNeel Infotech LLC. non-exclusive, royalty-free, and irrevocable right to use, reproduce, publish, and modify such content throughout the world in any media."}]},{id:"license-site-access",title:"License and S